<title>SPAIN: Escarrer family sold two pct in Sol Melia.</title>
<headline>Escarrer family sold two pct in Sol Melia.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Sol Melia said on Wednesday the Escarrer family, its principal shareholder, had sold a two percent stake in the hotel chain.</p>
<p>&quot;The Escarrer family has sold around two percent to AB Asesores,&quot; a spokesman told Reuters.</p>
</text>
